# Optional. Public URL of a third-party form endpoint that accepts a JSON POST
# and returns a 2xx status on success (for example a Formspree form URL such as
# https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz). This value is compiled into browser code,
# so it must be a public endpoint, never a secret or an API key.
# Leave empty to show the email-only contact experience.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
